    return `<div class="page-intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">运行证据</div><h1>运行与节点回放</h1><p>实际执行与设计模拟分开保存。成功运行不自动代表业务答案正确。</p></div></div><section class="panel"><h2>选择运行模式</h2><label class="field" for="run-mode">三种模式</label><select class="input" id="run-mode"><option value="design" ${runMode==='design'?'selected':''}>① 设计模拟 · 不执行节点函数</option><option value="framework" ${runMode==='framework'?'selected':''}>② 真实 LangGraph + 模拟模型</option><option value="real" ${runMode==='real'?'selected':''}>③ 真实 LangGraph + 真实模型</option></select><label class="field" for="run-case">测试用例</label><select class="input" id="run-case"><option value="custom" ${runCase==='custom'?'selected':''}>自定义问题</option>${(state().design?.contracts?.tests||[]).map(t=>`<option value="${escape(t.case)}" ${runCase===t.case?'selected':''} ${t.case==='tool_error'?'disabled':''}>${escape(({normal:'正常查询',invalid:'输入类型错误',missing:'缺少主题',no_result:'没有资料',tool_error:'工具失败：请由教练在隔离项目测试',out_of_scope:'任务范围外'})[t.case]||t.case)}</option>`).join('')}</select><label class="field" for="run-question">测试问题</label><input class="input" id="run-question" value="${escape(runQuestion)}" ${runCase!=='custom'?'readonly':''}><p class="muted">${runCase==='custom'?'自定义问题以文字输入': '预期：'+escape(state().design.contracts.tests.find(t=>t.case===runCase)?.expected||'')}</p><div class="button-row"><button class="btn primary" data-action="run-project" ${offline||dirty()||running?'disabled':''}>${running?'正在执行，等待实际结果…':'执行并记录轨迹'}</button></div><p class="muted">由当前工作台 Python 执行项目中已绑定的函数。框架模式需要 requirements-runtime.txt；真实模型从环境变量读取密钥。离线 HTML 只能看保存的结果。先保存草稿再运行。</p>${runResult?`<div class="callout ${runResult.status==='failed'?'warning':''}">${escape(runResult.evidence)} · ${escape(runResult.status)}<br>${escape(runResult.error||'')} ${runResult.stale?'项目中途更新，结果仅供历史参考。':''}</div>`:''}</section>${t?`<div class="trace-controls"><button class="btn" data-action="trace-prev" ${traceIndex===0?'disabled':''}>上一步</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="trace-next" ${traceIndex===traces.length-1?'disabled':''}>下一步</button><span>${traceIndex+1}/${traces.length} · ${escape(t.mode||'design')} · ${escape(t.run)}</span></div><div class="trace-steps">${traces.map((x,i)=>`<button class="${i===traceIndex?'active':''}" data-trace="${i}">${escape(x.node)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="two-col"><section class="panel"><h2>节点：${escape(t.node)}</h2><div class="diagram-box">${graph(state().agent_graph,t.node)}</div><p>${escape(t.basis)} · ${escape(t.duration_ms??'')} ms</p>${t.source?.path?`<button class="btn" data-source-path="${escape(t.source.path)}" data-source-line="${t.source.line}">查看实际代码：${escape(t.source.function)} · 第 ${t.source.line} 行</button>`:'<p>此步骤未关联实际代码，不能作为真实执行证明。</p>'}</section><section class="panel"><h2>完整状态变化</h2><h3>执行前 / 输入</h3><pre class="prose">${json(t.before??t.input)}</pre><h3>本节点写入</h3><pre class="prose">${json(t.update)}</pre><h3>执行后</h3><pre class="prose">${json(t.after??'旧轨迹没有完整状态快照')}</pre><h3>可见输出 / 错误</h3><pre class="prose">${json(t.output)}${escape(t.error||'')}</pre></section></div>`:'<section class="panel"><p>尚未记录轨迹。先在设计规范中绑定节点函数，再选择运行模式。</p></section>'}`;
